# Zimone: "At the beginning of your end step, if a land entered the battlefield under your control this turn and you control a prime number of
# lands, create Primo, the Indivisible ..., then put that many +1/+1 counters on it." Bot1 plays a land on turns 1, 3, 7 and 9 and none on turn 5.
# T1: one land (not prime), no Primo. T3: two lands (prime): Primo with two counters (2/2); Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4. T5: two lands
# are still prime but none entered this turn, so no Primo. T7: three lands: Primo with three counters (3/3), legendary Fractal, blue and green; Bot2's second Bolt kills it on turn 8. T9: four lands, not prime, though Bot2 controls
# three lands (prime) - the other side's lands do not count (CR 109.5) - so no Primo (CR 603.4).

